<title>USA: Stewart sells Gulf Coast John Deere dealer.</title>
<headline>Stewart sells Gulf Coast John Deere dealer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stewart &amp; Stevenson Services Inc said Friday its subsidiary C. Jim Stewart &amp; Stevenson Inc would sell a Gulf Coast John Deere dealership to Rush Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>The company said the dealership had about $25 million in sales in 1996. It added the deal is subject to a definitive agreement between the parties on or before August 31.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not immediately available to elaborate on the deal.</p>
</text>
